## Kept for our IDE, NOT app capabilities

- **editor-tools** (224): snippets, debuggers — useful in the Code view, weak as standalone app capabilities.
- **cosmetic** (35): themes, icon packs, keymaps — editor chrome only (still usable to theme OUR editor).
- **non-permissive** (434): excluded from shared-capability use pending license review.

## Next

- An agent pass can add a per-extension *app-use* line + sharpen domain/toolchain for the curated set.
- Wire the curated set into the Toolkits Extensions layer (filter by license/repurpose/domain/web).
